{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Machine-readable SDK versioning and support-window policy for every SDK surface. Validated by scripts/check-sdk-support-windows.mjs, which fails CI when a published version drifts from its declared support window or the documentation does not describe it. See docs/sdk-versioning.md and docs/runbooks/sdk-support-windows.md.",
